, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8794640, "raw_content": "", "author": "FusionBlack", "created": 1787496155297, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "beggarwaste", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "futurism.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNSkdhw.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://futurism.com/future-society/flock-quietly-selling-drones-scan-license-plates", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "\u201cIf you want a picture of the future, imagine a boot stamping on a human face\u2014for ever.\u201d", "last_comment_created": 1787498823165, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 8, "score_up": 39, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "Flock is selling \"Drone as First Responder\" tech, in the form of drones that are equipped with cameras that can read license plates.", "large_image": "FQwChUAs0Zhgm4Ef.png", "title": "Flock Is Quietly Selling Powerful Drones That Scan License Plates From the Sky"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCNSk5sV", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 56, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8794487, "raw_content": "", "author": "ArthurJ", "created": 1787488996519, "profile_picture": "2n7j40CvvfEB", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "TruthWillOut", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "wltreport.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNSk5sV.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://wltreport.com/2026/08/22/teen-demon-karoline-heintz-dead-jeep/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Teen Blames \u2018Demon\u2019 After Karoline Heintz Found Dead in Her Jeep. The 18-year-old suspect's mother is accused of helping him clean the vehicle, hide evidence and abandon Karoline\u2019s Jeep with her body still inside.", "last_comment_created": 1787502037249, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 56, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "A Pennsylvania teen charged in the killing of college soccer player Karoline Heintz told investigators a demon made him do it. Police say his mother then\u2026", "large_image": "UJo1jx9Hguuq7DPF.png", "title": "Teen Blames \u2018Demon\u2019 After Karoline Heintz Found Dead in Her Jeep | WLT Report"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCNSk5Tf", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 64, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8794423, "raw_content": "It's been months. He fell back in early June. Went to the ER in pain. They did an x-ray said everything is fine, gave him ibuprofen and a few referrals. \r\n\r\nHe has Medicare. He asked every doctor so far for an MRI and they say no that's \"premature\". They send him to physical therapy or offer more drugs but he doesn't want narcotics. He's been hobbling around for over 2 months. \r\n\r\nYesterday I asked him how it's going he said next appointment for an orthopedist is Sept 4. Said they still won't give him an MRI. His ankle is better but his knee is the size of a kids soccer ball..he showed me. The doctors say it's probably just swelling. \r\n\r\nWe discussed how the second an elite athlete feels a tiny ping they get a full MRI. But my neighbor who is suffering every day cannot get one approved. \r\n\r\nMeanwhile the 3 X-rays he's gotten have likely increased his risk of cancer by multiples. \r\n\r\nI wish there was something I could do for him. It's really messed up when the test he knows he needs is being withheld because of AMA \"guidance\". ", "author": "JoePlumber", "created": 1787486316542, "profile_picture": "WZEHyEIDoCvf", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "barwhack", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The entire US medical system is a scam. My neighbor fell and a twisted his ankle and hurt his knee. Went to the ER they gave him ibuprofen and a series of referrals....all he wants is an MRI and they still refuse. ", "last_comment_created": 1787497311843, "content": "<p>It's been months. He fell back in early June. Went to the ER in pain. They did an x-ray said everything is fine, gave him ibuprofen and a few referrals.</p>\n<p>He has Medicare. He asked every doctor so far for an MRI and they say no that's &quot;premature&quot;. They send him to physical therapy or offer more drugs but he doesn't want narcotics. He's been hobbling around for over 2 months.</p>\n<p>Yesterday I asked him how it's going he said next appointment for an orthopedist is Sept 4. Said they still won't give him an MRI. His ankle is better but his knee is the size of a kids soccer ball..he showed me. The doctors say it's probably just swelling.</p>\n<p>We discussed how the second an elite athlete feels a tiny ping they get a full MRI. But my neighbor who is suffering every day cannot get one approved.</p>\n<p>Meanwhile the 3 X-rays he's gotten have likely increased his risk of cancer by multiples.</p>\n<p>I wish there was something I could do for him. It's really messed up when the test he knows he needs is being withheld because of AMA &quot;guidance&quot;.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 18, "score_up": 64, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2091268706521186755", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCNRcn5O", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 611, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8793812, "raw_content": "", "author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "created": 1787441452573, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Scot", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNRcn5O.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/ksorbs/status/2091268706521186755?s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "\nKevin Sorbo\n:\nI know what would stop the beef crisis: deporting 20 million people.", "last_comment_created": 1787481874059, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 26, "score_up": 611, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 514, "created": 1787432288000, "id": "2091268706521186755", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1874